WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
 Oh, hi. Um, so, I heard that today is kind of a special day for humans. It's called Valentine's Day, I think, and I thought maybe I could give you some gifts, but not because I like you, so, um,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:58.960
 don't get the wrong idea or anything, because it's not like I like you, but I think I need to repay you for all the kindness that you've given me, so I thought maybe we could share some treats, and I also got you something fluffy, because I don't know about you, but fluffy things make me hungry, so you better be grateful, because I'm really going out of my way for you.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.280
 I got you some candy

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.680
 You know, you're really lucky

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.080
 You don't deserve such kindness

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:35.080
 But me, I feel generous today

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.080
 Okay, say ah

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.080
 Do you like it?

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.080
 Okay

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.080
 I mean, it's not a big deal or anything but

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.660
 I'm kind of happy that you like them

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:05.180
 I wasn't sure because I don't know what humans like

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:12.140
 but I think a lot of them like chocolate so it was a safe choice

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.640
 I have a ton more but we can have them later, okay?

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.140
 I also got you a present

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:45.080
 It's really fluffy and cuddly, so you can cuddle this whenever I'm not around, and if you miss me or anything, cause everyone knows that you miss me all the time.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:53.620
 So, whenever I'm not here, you can just cuddle that and think of me.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.880
 You better be grateful for this.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:02.480
 You know, I went through a lot of thinking to do this.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:15.560
 I put on a dress and, I mean, not for you, but for the occasion, it's not like I wanted to be pretty for you or anything.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:23.240
 So, don't think that. It's definitely not like that, okay?

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:29.440
 Um, but I am glad that you're here.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:40.840
 It's kind of embarrassing to admit it, but I really like you, human.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:45.000
 it's not, like, sappy or anything, I just

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.840
 I just think you're good to hang around with

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.660
 and you're more interesting than the other dragons, so

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:55.460
 I could keep you around for a little longer

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.340
 I really wouldn't mind

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.780
 I mean, as long as you behave yourself

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:04.720
 I was wondering, maybe

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.600
 do you have to make me say it?

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:24.340
 Well, I was wondering maybe if I could kiss you.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:28.840
 Okay, I'm not too embarrassed.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.840
 This is super, super lame and sappy.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.840
 I'm sorry.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.840
 Okay, whatever.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:58.200
 You know, you're pretty dumb.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.000
 You're a big dummy.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:02.200
 You know why?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.320
 Because you're with a dragon like me.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:16.880
 You know that dragons eat people, right?

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:21.040
 I could eat you, at any moment.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.160
 Like this.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.160
 Om nom nom nom nom nom.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.160
 Om nom nom nom nom.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.840
 What would you do if I ate you?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:44.440
 Really though, how many humans aren't afraid of dragons?

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:51.100
 I think there's really, really something wrong with you if you aren't afraid of me at all.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:06:03.200
 I mean, any other time that I've heard of humans, they would be running for their lives from my family or from the other dragons.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:10.680
 I don't know why, but you stuck around and you were just a huge, giant idiot

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:15.360
 and you put your life at risk just to talk to him

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.780
 You're really, really stupid

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:49.040
 So

00:06:49.040 --> 00:07:02.720
 I hope that today is a really good Valentine's Day for you

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:18.640
 Even if I'm mean sometimes, I want you to know that I'm here for you.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:30.420
 I'm sorry that I'm not good at expressing my feelings sometimes, but I'm good at expressing

00:07:30.420 --> 00:08:00.140
 them like this so if you ever feel lonely or need somebody to talk to

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:12.300
 too. I'll be here. So, yeah. I hope that doesn't bother you. I hope that I'm not in your way.

00:08:30.140 --> 00:09:00.120
 I'm going to go to the next one.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:30.120
 Thank you.

00:09:30.140 --> 00:10:00.120
 Thank you.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:30.120
 Thank you.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:33.140
 I love you

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.140
 I love you

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:02.100
 I love you so much that I'm going to eat you.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:19.100
 Nom nom nom nom nom nom. Nom nom nom nom nom nom. I'm just teasing you. I wouldn't actually eat you. But sometimes you're just so cute that I can't help it. I just wanna...

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:23.100
 Om nom nom nom nom.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:56.100
 Nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom, nom.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:12:00.100
 So like, don't get used to this, okay?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.100
 This is a really special day for you.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:07.100
 So, I just wanted to make it a good day.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.100
 And I wanted to make it special.

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:15.100
 So, don't get used to getting pampered like this.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:31.100
 I mean, I'd still enjoy your company at any time, but just know that I'm going to be here, and I'm going to make sure that you're safe. I'll protect you from any other dragons.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.580
 I will protect you, okay?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.560
 I'll keep you safe

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.680
 And you're going to be okay

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:44.360
 I know that you're a huge weakling

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.900
 So I'm here to protect you

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:51.640
 Because, you know, you need to be protected

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.120
 Or else you will get eaten

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.460
 Nom nom nom nom nom nom

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.920
 I'm the only one who's allowed to eat you

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:10.920
 Om nom nom nom nom nom nom nom nom.

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:58.900
 I'm going to go ahead and do a little bit.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:28.900
 Thank you.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:42.080
 you've been super nice to me

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:46.600
 even though

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:50.340
 I burned you

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:54.320
 and even though

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.300
 I smacked you on the head

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:03.580
 And chomped on your skin

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:13.260
 Even though I say mean things

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:23.700
 Sometimes

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:30.360
 I'm just a little awkward

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.180
 So

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:36.020
 No matter how many names I call you

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:39.720
 And no matter how much I tell you to go away

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.940
 Do not leave my side

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:47.220
 Stay with me forever

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:50.340
 Because I'm your dragon

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:53.860
 And you're my human

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:58.720
 So I need you to stay with me

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:05.560
 As long as you stay with me

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.480
 I'll protect you

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.120
 And I'll take care of you

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:17.940
 and I'll give you occasional hugs

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:21.940
 and maybe a couple kisses

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:31.940
 but you have to eat my cookie

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:34.940
 no matter how bad it is

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.940
 no matter how burned it is

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:49.440
 So, do we have a deal?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:54.440
 Okay, I like the sound of that.

00:16:54.440 --> 00:17:23.600
 I hope that this day has been special for you.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.440
 Because it was really special for me

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:37.360
 So make sure you remember this, and even though I don't usually see it

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.880
 I try my hardest to make you happy

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:50.400
 Be grateful because dragons don't usually do favors for other dragons or humans, definitely not humans

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.160
 So

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:57.840
 I hope I see you being alive

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.840
 And I hope you see me too

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:07.840
 Happy Valentine's Day

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.840
 Sleep tight
